Privacy Policy for Muslim Prayer

Effective Date: October 10, 2026

1. Introduction

Welcome to Muslim Prayer. We respect your privacy and are committed to protecting your personal information.

This Privacy Policy explains how Muslim Prayer collects, uses, stores, and shares information when you use our mobile application.

By using Muslim Prayer, you agree to the practices described in this Privacy Policy.

2. Information We Collect

A. Location Information

Muslim Prayer may request access to your device's location to provide relevant features, including:

- Accurate local prayer times.
- Location-based prayer schedules.
- Relevant religious information based on your location.

Location access is subject to your device permissions. You can disable location access through your device settings. If you do so, some location-based features may not work correctly.

We do not intentionally use your location for purposes unrelated to providing the app's features.

B. Device Information and Advertising

Muslim Prayer may display advertisements provided by third-party advertising partners.

These advertising partners may automatically collect certain information, such as:

- Device identifiers.
- IP address.
- Device type and operating system.
- Advertising interactions.
- General usage and diagnostic information.

This information may be used to display advertisements, measure advertising performance, prevent advertising fraud, and improve advertising services.

The information collected depends on the advertising services integrated into the app.

C. Personal Information

Muslim Prayer does not require you to provide personal information such as your name, phone number, or home address unless a specific feature requests it.

If the app includes an account or login feature, the information processed will depend on the account services used by the app.

3. How We Use Information

Information may be used to:

- Calculate or display local prayer times.
- Provide location-based features.
- Operate and maintain the application.
- Display and measure advertisements.
- Detect technical problems and prevent misuse.
- Improve the application's functionality and reliability.

We do not sell users' personal information.

4. Third-Party Services

Muslim Prayer may use third-party services to support advertising, analytics, location-based features, or application functionality.

These services may process information according to their own privacy policies and terms.

Third-party providers may include advertising networks such as Google AdMob, if integrated into the application.

Please review the privacy policies of the services actually used by the app before publishing this policy.

5. Data Sharing

We do not sell personal information to third parties.

Information may be shared with service providers when necessary to operate the application, provide advertisements, maintain security, or comply with applicable legal requirements.

Any information processed by third-party services is subject to the relevant providers' privacy practices.

6. Data Security

We take reasonable measures to protect information processed through Muslim Prayer.

However, no electronic storage or transmission method can be guaranteed to be completely secure.

We encourage users to keep their devices and applications updated.

7. Data Retention and Deletion

We retain information only for as long as reasonably necessary for the purposes described in this Privacy Policy or as required by applicable law.

Location information may be processed when needed to provide location-based prayer features.

Where information is stored by third-party service providers, its retention and deletion may also be governed by their policies.

If you have a question or request concerning personal information associated with your use of the app, you may contact us using the email address provided below.

If account creation is available in the app, users will be provided with an appropriate method to request account deletion.

8. Children's Privacy

Muslim Prayer is a religious utility application intended for general use.

We do not knowingly collect personal information from children without appropriate authorization where required by law.

If you believe a child has provided personal information inappropriately, please contact us so that we can review the matter.

9. Your Choices and Permissions

You can control certain information access through your device settings, including location permissions and advertising preferences where supported.

Disabling permissions may affect some application features.

You may also uninstall Muslim Prayer at any time to stop using the application.

10. Changes to This Privacy Policy

We may update this Privacy Policy when our application, services, or legal requirements change.

Any updated version will be published at the location where this Privacy Policy is hosted, together with a revised effective date when appropriate.

